  "_comment": "The single content list for the archive. Edit this file to add, change or remove projects — nothing else needs touching. 'image' is a filename inside public/; its small copy in public/thumb/ is generated automatically. 'category' is an id from the categories list below. 'slug' is the project's own address, used by its detail page. Titles and category labels carry both languages. The ring groups cards by category in the order given here, and opens on the first one.",
